    "text": "A formation F of finite groups satisfies the Wielandt property for residuals if\nwhenever U and V are subnormal subgroups of ⟨U, V ⟩ in a finite group G, then the\nF-residual ⟨U, V ⟩F of ⟨U, V ⟩ coincides with ⟨U F , V F ⟩. Does every Fitting formation F\nsatisfy the Wielandt property for residuals?                         A. Ballester-Bolinches",
